# Testing and verification

## Tests and stories

- Tests and stories sit next to the file they cover, inside the slice library: `src/lib/ui/<slice>/<slice>.test.tsx`, `src/lib/ui/<slice>/<slice>.stories.tsx`.
- Storybook is per slice. Add it with `--storybook=true` only when the task asks for it. Do not export stories from `src/index.ts`.
- If the repo has no test runner (see `10-project-context`), do not invent one or add test files unless asked.

## Verify every change

- Gate: `node .agents/skills/feature-sliced-nx/scripts/gate.mjs` exits 0. The reply names the command and its result.
- When the change touched Storybook, `nx affected -t build-storybook,test-storybook` exits 0.
- Lint and type-check: 0 errors when `10-project-context` lists those commands.
- UI changes: exercise the changed flow in the browser against the dev server. Reuse a running server.
- Do not report unverified work as done.
